msgid ""
"The customer had neither an NPWP nor an identity document (NIK, passport) when the invoice was "
"issued. Enter one on the contact for future invoices, or create this faktur in Coretax directly."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan belum memiliki NPWP maupun dokumen identitas (NIK, paspor) saat faktur diterbitkan. Isi "
"pada data kontak untuk faktur berikutnya, atau buat faktur ini langsung di Coretax."

