msgid "The invoice carries no PPN."
msgstr "Faktur ini tidak dikenai PPN."

#: apps/invoicing/coretax.py:299
msgid ""
"The invoice mixes the 11/12 tax base with the full tax base; Coretax needs a separate faktur for "
