msgid ""
"A change in estimate applies from then on (SAK EMKM): depreciation already posted stays, and the "
"remaining book value less the new residual value is depreciated over the remaining months with the"
" chosen method."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan estimasi berlaku ke depan (SAK EMKM): penyusutan yang sudah dijurnal tetap, dan sisa "
"nilai buku dikurangi nilai residu baru disusutkan selama sisa bulan dengan metode yang dipilih."

#: templates/assets/asset_detail.html:78
