"Depreciation runs to the end of the month before the disposal and is posted first if it is still "
"due. The entry removes the cost and accumulated depreciation, records the proceeds and books the "
"difference as a gain or loss."
msgstr ""
"Penyusutan berjalan sampai akhir bulan sebelum pelepasan dan dijurnal lebih dulu bila belum. "
"Jurnal pelepasan menghapus biaya perolehan dan akumulasi penyusutan, mencatat hasil penjualan, dan"
