#: templates/payroll/index.html:28
#, python-format
msgid ""
"PPh 21 (PP 58/2023): January to November use the monthly effective rate (TER) of the employee's "
"category on gross income, including the JKK, JKM and BPJS Kesehatan premiums the employer pays; "
"the last month of the year (December, or the month an employee leaves) uses the Article 17 rates "
"on the year's income, less what was withheld before. Non-permanent workers: the monthly TER, or "
"the daily rates for those paid by the day. Non-resident foreigners: 20%% PPh 26. Without an NPWP "
"(or NIK), PPh 21 is 20%% higher. Deposit under Taxes → Withheld income tax by the 15th of the next"
" month."
msgstr ""
"PPh 21 (PP 58/2023): Januari sampai November memakai tarif efektif bulanan (TER) sesuai kategori "
"karyawan atas penghasilan bruto, termasuk premi JKK, JKM dan BPJS Kesehatan yang dibayar pemberi "
"kerja; masa pajak terakhir (Desember, atau bulan karyawan berhenti) memakai tarif Pasal 17 atas "
"penghasilan setahun, dikurangi yang sudah dipotong. Pegawai tidak tetap: TER bulanan, atau tarif "
"harian bagi yang dibayar harian. WNA bukan wajib pajak dalam negeri: PPh 26 20%%. Tanpa NPWP (atau"
" NIK), PPh 21 20%% lebih tinggi. Setor di Pajak → PPh yang dipotong paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan"
" berikutnya."

