#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:54
msgid "Record tax payment"
msgstr "Catat setoran"

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:61
msgid ""
"Legal basis: PP 55/2022. Payment is due by the 15th of the following month. Gross turnover is "
"calculated from posted operating revenue accounts."
msgstr ""
"Dasar hukum: PP 55/2022. Setoran paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya. Peredaran bruto "
"dihitung dari akun Pendapatan Usaha yang telah diposting."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:62
msgid ""
"Under SAK EMKM's accrual basis, each month's PPh Final is an expense of that month: record it "
"after the month ends (it is posted on the last day of the month as a liability), and the payment "
"settles the liability. Recording a payment also records a missing expense."
msgstr ""
"Dengan dasar akrual SAK EMKM, PPh Final setiap bulan merupakan beban bulan itu: catat setelah "
"bulan berakhir (dijurnal pada hari terakhir bulan sebagai utang), lalu setoran melunasi utang "
"tersebut. Mencatat setoran juga mencatat beban yang belum ada."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:63
msgid ""
"PPh Final that buyers withheld from your receipts (with your Surat Keterangan PP 55) is deposited "
"by them: it counts towards the month of the receipt, and you deposit only the rest."
msgstr ""
"PPh Final yang dipotong pembeli dari penerimaan Anda (dengan Surat Keterangan PP 55 Anda) disetor "
"oleh mereka: diperhitungkan pada bulan penerimaan, dan Anda hanya menyetor sisanya."

#: templates/taxes/pph_final.html:67
msgid "Record PPh Final payment"
msgstr "Catat Setoran PPh Final"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:5
#, python-format
msgid "Self-deposited final PPh %(year)s"
msgstr "PPh final disetor sendiri %(year)s"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:16
msgid "Cancel this self-deposit?"
msgstr "Batalkan setoran sendiri ini?"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:17
msgid "No self-deposited tax this year."
msgstr "Belum ada pajak yang disetor sendiri tahun ini."

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:21
msgid "Record a self-deposit"
msgstr "Catat setoran sendiri"

#: templates/taxes/self_deposits.html:26
#, python-format
msgid ""
"When your customer doesn't withhold the final PPh on your income (e.g. a tenant who isn't a "
"withholding agent, 10%% on rent), you deposit it yourself by the 15th of the next month. It is an "
"expense of the month of the income; its deposit settles it. Each one is reported with a BPSP, in "
"the month's eBupot files (Withheld income tax)."
msgstr ""
"Jika pelanggan tidak memotong PPh final atas penghasilan Anda (mis. penyewa yang bukan pemotong "
"pajak, 10%% atas sewa), Anda menyetorkannya sendiri paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya. PPh"
" tersebut menjadi beban bulan penghasilannya; setorannya melunasinya. Masing-masing dilaporkan "
"dengan BPSP, dalam berkas eBupot bulan itu (PPh yang dipotong)."

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_form.html:4
msgid "Edit rate"
msgstr "Ubah Tarif"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_form.html:4 templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:6
msgid "New rate"
msgstr "Tarif Baru"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:9
msgid ""
"This organization is not yet a PKP, so PPN cannot be charged on sales invoices. PPN on purchases "
"will be expensed."
msgstr ""
"Organisasi belum berstatus PKP, jadi PPN tidak dapat dipungut pada faktur penjualan. PPN pada "
"pembelian akan dibebankan ke biaya."

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:12
msgid "DPP"
msgstr "DPP"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:12
msgid "Effective rate"
msgstr "Tarif Efektif"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:14
msgid "besaran tertentu (code 05)"
msgstr "besaran tertentu (kode 05)"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:16 templates/tenants/settings.html:26
msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:20
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Since 1 January 2025 (PMK 131/2024) the PPN rate is 12%%; for non-luxury goods and services the "
"tax base (DPP) is 11/12 of the price, so the effective rate is 11%%."
msgstr ""
"Sejak 1 Januari 2025 (PMK 131/2024) tarif PPN 12%%; untuk barang/jasa non-mewah DPP memakai nilai "
"lain 11/12 sehingga tarif efektif 11%%."

#: templates/taxes/taxrate_list.html:21
msgid ""
"PPnBM on luxury goods is charged on the same tax base, posted to PPnBM Keluaran on sales and to "
"the cost on purchases (it can't be credited)."
msgstr ""
"PPnBM atas barang mewah dikenakan pada DPP yang sama, dicatat ke PPnBM Keluaran pada penjualan dan"
" ke harga perolehan pada pembelian (tidak dapat dikreditkan)."

