#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:30
msgid "Bukti potong"
msgstr "Bukti potong"

#: templates/taxes/withholding.html:21
msgid "No income tax was withheld this year. Record it when paying a bill or running payroll."
msgstr ""
"Belum ada PPh yang dipotong tahun ini. Catat saat membayar tagihan atau menjalankan penggajian."

#: templates/taxes/withholding.html:23
msgid ""
"When you pay a supplier for services (PPh 23), rent of land or buildings (PPh 4(2)) or an "
"individual's fee (PPh 21), and when you pay salaries (PPh 21, or PPh 26 for non-residents), you "
"withhold the tax, deposit it by the 15th of the next month and give a bukti potong from Coretax "
"eBupot. Withholding in a month that is already deposited is refused: cancel the deposit first."
msgstr ""
"Saat membayar pemasok untuk jasa (PPh 23), sewa tanah atau bangunan (PPh 4(2)) atau imbalan orang "
"pribadi (PPh 21), dan saat membayar gaji (PPh 21, atau PPh 26 untuk WPLN), Anda memotong pajaknya,"
" menyetorkannya paling lambat tanggal 15 bulan berikutnya, dan memberikan bukti potong dari "
"Coretax eBupot. Pemotongan pada bulan yang sudah disetor ditolak: batalkan setorannya terlebih "
"dahulu."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:6
#, python-format
msgid "Bukti potong %(period)s %(year)s"
msgstr "Bukti potong %(period)s %(year)s"

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:18
#, python-format
msgid "50%% × Art. 17"
msgstr "50%% × Pasal 17"

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:23
msgid "No income tax was withheld from suppliers this month."
msgstr "Tidak ada PPh yang dipotong dari pemasok bulan ini."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:25
#, python-format
msgid "PPh 21 and PPh 26 withheld from salaries: <a href=\"%(url)s\">payroll %(period)s</a>."
msgstr "PPh 21 dan PPh 26 yang dipotong dari gaji: <a href=\"%(url)s\">penggajian %(period)s</a>."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:26
msgid "Create each bukti potong in Coretax (eBupot) from this list, then record its number here."
msgstr "Buat setiap bukti potong di Coretax (eBupot) dari daftar ini, lalu catat nomornya di sini."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:28
msgid "Coretax eBupot files"
msgstr "Berkas eBupot Coretax"

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:30
msgid "File"
msgstr "Berkas"

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:36
msgid "Send this file to Coretax?"
msgstr "Kirim berkas ini ke Coretax?"

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:38
msgid "No bukti potong are waiting for a number this month."
msgstr "Tidak ada bukti potong yang menunggu nomor bulan ini."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:40
#, python-format
msgid "To send them from here, <a href=\"%(url)s\">connect to Coretax</a>."
msgstr "Untuk mengirim dari sini, <a href=\"%(url)s\">hubungkan ke Coretax</a>."

#: templates/taxes/withholding_month.html:41
msgid ""
"Files in DJP's eBupot import format: upload them in Coretax (eBupot → Impor Data), or send them "
"through your Coretax connection, which records the numbers Coretax gives back. Bukti potong that "
"already have a number are left out. Daily workers get one bukti potong per day worked."
msgstr ""
"Berkas dalam format impor eBupot DJP: unggah di Coretax (eBupot → Impor Data), atau kirim melalui "
"koneksi Coretax Anda, yang mencatat nomor yang diberikan Coretax. Bukti potong yang sudah bernomor"
" tidak diikutkan. Pekerja harian mendapat satu bukti potong per hari kerja."

